#: 5ac6744c42cc4ece8bc2193bc20c9257
msgid "Put the board into SSBL dfu mode - power off, hold BIND (not BOOT), power on - LED flashes fast, release BIND, LED flashed slow - DFU mode enabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:159
#: ce5eff541b9545929d52ed8168346a6f
msgid "Flash the binary using"
msgstr ""

