msgid "Verify the flash. The dfu-util command below copies the contents of the flash back to the computer, the diff command will tell you if the contents are identical or different. Do not attempt to fly if diff doesn't say the files are identical - retry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.rst:172
#: 5365cb00bc2e44ceafde97fbf81625b7
msgid "Power off, install an SD card (.note: you *must* install an SD card, the firmware will not boot without it), power on"
msgstr ""

